  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICF Country Level intervention, learning and communication activities to increase economic opportunities for smallholder farmers</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NIRAS, in association with Swisscontact, delivers market systems development work in Malawi and Nepal, with projects in Rwanda and Ethiopia starting in 2023. Component A supports early-stage agri-SMEs to trial innovative business models and growth strategies, which bring more smallholders into selected commercial value chains and demonstrate proof of concept to investors. Under FCDO&#x2019;s contract with NIRAS, CABI undertakes policy-relevant evidence work, lesson learning and strategic communication activities.</narrative>
  </description>
